note How the owner reviews an agent session's map changes without reading path output. The map at the parent revision comes from jj or git (Vcs, a shell-out, no VCS library); the working map is diffed against it by path name and step id. The CLI prints it as diff; the GUI shows it as the Diff tab, as marks in the Paths list, and as tags on the steps of a document.

